      "SYLVIE: Oh, this is my cousin Mona.\nMONA: Mona-lisa -- Like the paintin'.",
      "MONA: Make sure she gets home okay. Call you tomorrow Sylvie.\nSYLVIE: Mona?!",
      "SYLVIE: Well, no -- not officially. But, you did ask, and I came -- so, I guess it kinda was a date.\nEUNICE: Sylvie?! Is that you?\nSYLVIE: Yes, momma -- I'll be right up. See you tomorrow.",
